{"name":"瀑布流","description":"瀑布流是一种保持列对齐、让不同高度的卡片依次补进当前最短列的页面布局 · 作品墙和灵感流里的图片高度各不相同，瀑布流让新卡片补进最短的空隙，页面不会出现整行留白。代价是阅读顺序按列推进而不是按行；手机端收成单列后，内容顺序需要单独验收。 先知道 卡片 Card 网格布局 Grid","quote":"图片高矮不一样，别硬裁成一样高，矮的下面自动补上新的就行。","agentPrompt":"把作品墙改成瀑布流：列宽一致，图片保持原始比例，新图片补到当前最短的列；手机收成一列。改完后用桌面和手机各检查一次：矮图下方没有整行留白，从上往下浏览时内容顺序仍然合理。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-masonry-layout\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>瀑布流<span>Masonry</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">图片高矮不一样，别硬裁成一样高，矮的下面自动补上新的就行。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">瀑布流是一种保持列对齐、让不同高度的卡片依次补进当前最短列的页面布局</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>作品墙和灵感流里的图片高度各不相同，瀑布流让新卡片补进最短的空隙，页面不会出现整行留白。代价是阅读顺序按列推进而不是按行；手机端收成单列后，内容顺序需要单独验收。</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"先知道\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">先知道</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/card?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"card\">卡片 <b>Card</b></a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/grid?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"grid\">网格布局 <b>Grid</b></a></div></div></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>瀑布流布局</em><em>Masonry 布局</em><em>Masonry Layout</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo responsive-detail-demo diagram-detail-demo\" style=\"--detail-demo-width:400px\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"masonry-demo\">\n    <figure class=\"masonry-panel\">\n      <figcaption><b>卡片网格</b><span>行被最高的卡片撑开，矮卡片下方留白</span></figcaption>\n      <div class=\"masonry-wall is-grid\">\n        <span class=\"masonry-cell\" style=\"--cell:64px\"><i style=\"--h:44px\">1</i></span>\n        <span class=\"masonry-cell\" style=\"--cell:64px\"><i style=\"--h:64px\">2</i></span>\n        <span class=\"masonry-cell\" style=\"--cell:64px\"><i style=\"--h:36px\">3</i></span>\n        <span class=\"masonry-cell\" style=\"--cell:60px\"><i style=\"--h:52px\">4</i></span>\n        <span class=\"masonry-cell\" style=\"--cell:60px\"><i style=\"--h:40px\">5</i></span>\n        <span class=\"masonry-cell\" style=\"--cell:60px\"><i style=\"--h:60px\">6</i></span>\n      </div>\n    </figure>\n    <figure class=\"masonry-panel\">\n      <figcaption><b>瀑布流</b><span>4 补进最短列，横向扫读变成 5、6、4</span></figcaption>\n      <div class=\"masonry-wall is-flow\">\n        <div class=\"masonry-col\"><i style=\"--h:44px\">1</i><i style=\"--h:40px\">5</i></div>\n        <div class=\"masonry-col\"><i style=\"--h:64px\">2</i><i style=\"--h:60px\">6</i></div>\n        <div class=\"masonry-col\"><i style=\"--h:36px\">3</i><i class=\"is-new\" style=\"--h:52px\">4</i></div>\n      </div>\n    </figure>\n    <figure class=\"masonry-panel masonry-panel-phone\">\n      <figcaption><b>手机端</b><span>收成一列，回到 1 到 6 的原始顺序</span></figcaption>\n      <div class=\"masonry-wall is-phone\">\n        <i style=\"--h:30px\">1</i><i style=\"--h:40px\">2</i><i style=\"--h:26px\">3</i><i style=\"--h:34px\">4</i>\n      </div>\n    </figure>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>把作品墙改成瀑布流：列宽一致，图片保持原始比例，新图片补到当前最短的列；手机收成一列。改完后用桌面和手机各检查一次：矮图下方没有整行留白，从上往下浏览时内容顺序仍然合理。</p></blockquote></section></div><section class=\"distinctions\"><div class=\"section-title\">容易混淆？这样区分</div><div class=\"distinction-grid\"><div class=\"distinction-card\"><div class=\"distinction-head\"><span>瀑布流<small>Masonry</small></span><b>≠</b><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/card-grid-layout?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"card-grid-layout\">卡片网格布局 <b>Card Grid</b></a></div><p><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/card-grid-layout?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"card-grid-layout\" aria-label=\"卡片网格布局 Card Grid\">卡片网格布局 <b>Card Grid</b></a> 保持严格行列对齐、同行等高，适合比较和扫描；<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/masonry-layout?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"masonry-layout\" aria-label=\"瀑布流 Masonry\">瀑布流 <b>Masonry</b></a> 放弃行对齐换取紧凑，适合以看为主的浏览。</p></div><div class=\"distinction-card\"><div class=\"distinction-head\"><span>瀑布流<small>Masonry</small></span><b>≠</b><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/style-bento?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"style-bento\">Bento 便当格 <b>Bento Grid</b></a></div><p><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/style-bento?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"style-bento\" aria-label=\"Bento 便当格 Bento Grid\">Bento 便当格 <b>Bento Grid</b></a> 用格子大小表达设计好的内容优先级；<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/masonry-layout?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"masonry-layout\" aria-label=\"瀑布流 Masonry\">瀑布流 <b>Masonry</b></a> 的位置由补位规则自动产生，不表达优先级。</p></div></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>作品墙</b>：摄影、插画比例不一，保持原始比例展示，见 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/card?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"card\" aria-label=\"卡片 Card\">卡片 <b>Card</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><span style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;width:100%\"><span style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span style=\"height:16px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"height:10px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span></span><span style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span style=\"height:10px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"height:16px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span></span><span style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span style=\"height:13px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"height:13px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span></span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">灵感、素材内容流：强调连续向下浏览，不需要逐行比较</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:flex;gap:4px\"><span style=\"flex:1;height:14px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"flex:1;height:20px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"flex:1;height:11px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">向下滚动继续加载</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">商品或案例封面尺寸不统一，又希望页面紧凑</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row between\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">降噪耳机</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">¥ 899</span></div><div class=\"mk-row between\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">护眼台灯</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">¥ 199</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>纵向空间紧张</b>：内容持续增长，补位比整行留白更省高度</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:30px;height:22px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"width:30px;height:14px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"width:30px;height:18px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">内容有严格先后顺序（步骤、时间线）：<b>补位会打乱顺序</b></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">步骤 1</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">步骤 2</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">步骤 4 排到了步骤 3 前面</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要逐行比较同类信息：列不对齐时比较成本更高，用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/card-grid-layout?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"card-grid-layout\" aria-label=\"卡片网格布局 Card Grid\">卡片网格布局 <b>Card Grid</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:30%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:22%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-row\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:24%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:34%\"></i></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">手机端仍保留多列：<b>卡片被压得过窄</b>，应收成一到两列</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2px;width:80px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:3px\"><span style=\"flex:1;height:30px;background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"flex:1;height:30px;background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"flex:1;height:30px;background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:2px\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把长文列表也塞进瀑布流：阅读顺序混乱，段落难以连续读完</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:75%\"></i></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"columns\"><span class=\"masonry-anat-wall\"><span class=\"masonry-anat-col\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"card\"><span class=\"masonry-anat-card on\">卡片</span></span><span class=\"masonry-anat-card tall\"></span></span><span class=\"masonry-anat-col\"><span class=\"masonry-anat-card tall\"></span><span class=\"masonry-anat-card\"></span></span><span class=\"masonry-anat-col\"><span class=\"masonry-anat-card short\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"fill\"><span class=\"masonry-anat-card fill\">补位</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"columns\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">等宽的列</span><span class=\"pe\">Equal Columns</span></button><span class=\"pd\">列宽保持一致，只有高度自由变化</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"card\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">不同高度的卡片</span><span class=\"pe\">Cards of Varying Height</span></button><span class=\"pd\">卡片保持内容原始比例，不被裁成统一高度</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"fill\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">补位</span><span class=\"pe\">Gap Filling</span></button><span class=\"pd\">下一张卡片进入当前最短的列，这也是顺序被打乱的原因</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">三列<span>Three Columns</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;width:110px\"><i class=\"masonry-v-col\"><b style=\"height:16px\"></b><b style=\"height:10px\"></b></i><i class=\"masonry-v-col\"><b style=\"height:10px\"></b><b style=\"height:16px\"></b></i><i class=\"masonry-v-col\"><b style=\"height:13px\"></b><b style=\"height:13px\"></b></i></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">桌面作品墙和内容流的常见列数</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">两列<span>Two Columns</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;width:110px\"><i class=\"masonry-v-col\"><b style=\"height:16px\"></b><b style=\"height:10px\"></b></i><i class=\"masonry-v-col\"><b style=\"height:10px\"></b><b style=\"height:16px\"></b></i></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">窄屏或需要更大卡片预览时</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">单列<span>Single Column</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span style=\"display:flex;width:110px\"><i class=\"masonry-v-col\"><b style=\"height:8px\"></b><b style=\"height:11px\"></b><b style=\"height:7px\"></b></i></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">手机端默认形态，内容回到原始顺序</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">摄影作品墙</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"columns:3;column-gap:8px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n        <div style=\"height:56px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#c9cdd4,#e8eaee)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">晨雾港口</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n        <div style=\"height:88px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#a9b4c2,#d5dbe3)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">山城步道</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n        <div style=\"height:44px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#d9cFC2,#eee7db)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">静物练习</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n        <div style=\"height:70px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#b8c4b2,#dde4d7)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">植物园温室</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n        <div style=\"height:52px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#c4b8c9,#e2dbe6)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">老城夜色</div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">插画灵感流</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px\" placeholder=\"搜索灵感：包装、海报、字体…\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px\">筛选</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"columns:3;column-gap:8px\">\n        <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);height:52px;border:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);height:76px;border:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);height:40px;border:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);height:64px;border:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-soft);height:48px;border:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">已收藏 236 条灵感 · 向下滚动继续加载</div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">商品封面列表</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"columns:2;column-gap:8px;max-width:480px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"height:58px;background:var(--bg-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px\">🎧</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">降噪耳机 Pro</div><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">¥ 899</b></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"height:84px;background:var(--bg-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px\">🪑</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">人体工学椅</div><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">¥ 1,299</b></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"height:46px;background:var(--bg-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px\">💡</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">护眼台灯</div><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">¥ 199</b></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"height:66px;background:var(--bg-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px\">⌨️</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">机械键盘</div><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">¥ 349</b></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">素材模板库</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"columns:3;column-gap:8px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n        <div style=\"height:44px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand-light),#fff);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">作品集模板</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">免费</span><button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:2px 8px;font-size:12px\">使用</button></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n        <div style=\"height:68px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--red-light),#fff);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">活动报名页</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">免费</span><button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:2px 8px;font-size:12px\">使用</button></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n        <div style=\"height:52px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--green-light),#fff);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">博客主题</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">免费</span><button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:2px 8px;font-size:12px\">使用</button></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Grid_layout/Masonry_layout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">CSS 网格布局：瀑布流布局</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Multicol_layout/Basic_concepts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">多列布局的基本概念</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/masonry-layout","markdown":"# 瀑布流Masonry\n\n你可能会说\n图片高矮不一样，别硬裁成一样高，矮的下面自动补上新的就行。\n\n**瀑布流是一种保持列对齐、让不同高度的卡片依次补进当前最短列的页面布局**·作品墙和灵感流里的图片高度各不相同，瀑布流让新卡片补进最短的空隙，页面不会出现整行留白。代价是阅读顺序按列推进而不是按行；手机端收成单列后，内容顺序需要单独验收。\n先知道\n[卡片 **Card**](/vibe-hub/card?lang=zh)[网格布局 **Grid**](/vibe-hub/grid?lang=zh)\n\n也常被叫作瀑布流布局Masonry 布局Masonry Layout\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 把作品墙改成瀑布流：列宽一致，图片保持原始比例，新图片补到当前最短的列；手机收成一列。改完后用桌面和手机各检查一次：矮图下方没有整行留白，从上往下浏览时内容顺序仍然合理。\n\n容易混淆？这样区分\n\n瀑布流Masonry**≠**[卡片网格布局 **Card Grid**](/vibe-hub/card-grid-layout?lang=zh)\n\n[卡片网格布局 **Card Grid**](/vibe-hub/card-grid-layout?lang=zh) 保持严格行列对齐、同行等高，适合比较和扫描；[瀑布流 **Masonry**](/vibe-hub/masonry-layout?lang=zh) 放弃行对齐换取紧凑，适合以看为主的浏览。\n\n瀑布流Masonry**≠**[Bento 便当格 **Bento Grid**](/vibe-hub/style-bento?lang=zh)\n\n[Bento 便当格 **Bento Grid**](/vibe-hub/style-bento?lang=zh) 用格子大小表达设计好的内容优先级；[瀑布流 **Masonry**](/vibe-hub/masonry-layout?lang=zh) 的位置由补位规则自动产生，不表达优先级。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **作品墙**：摄影、插画比例不一，保持原始比例展示，见 [卡片 **Card**](/vibe-hub/card?lang=zh)\n- 灵感、素材内容流：强调连续向下浏览，不需要逐行比较\n\n向下滚动继续加载\n- 商品或案例封面尺寸不统一，又希望页面紧凑\n\n降噪耳机¥ 899\n\n护眼台灯¥ 199\n- **纵向空间紧张**：内容持续增长，补位比整行留白更省高度\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 内容有严格先后顺序（步骤、时间线）：**补位会打乱顺序**\n\n步骤 1步骤 2\n\n步骤 4 排到了步骤 3 前面\n- 需要逐行比较同类信息：列不对齐时比较成本更高，用 [卡片网格布局 **Card Grid**](/vibe-hub/card-grid-layout?lang=zh)\n- 手机端仍保留多列：**卡片被压得过窄**，应收成一到两列\n- 把长文列表也塞进瀑布流：阅读顺序混乱，段落难以连续读完\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n卡片补位\n\n1等宽的列Equal Columns列宽保持一致，只有高度自由变化\n\n2不同高度的卡片Cards of Varying Height卡片保持内容原始比例，不被裁成统一高度\n\n3补位Gap Filling下一张卡片进入当前最短的列，这也是顺序被打乱的原因\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n三列Three Columns\n\n************************\n\n桌面作品墙和内容流的常见列数\n\n两列Two Columns\n\n****************\n\n窄屏或需要更大卡片预览时\n\n单列Single Column\n\n************\n\n手机端默认形态，内容回到原始顺序\n\n典型使用场景\n\n摄影作品墙\n\n晨雾港口\n\n      \n山城步道\n\n      \n静物练习\n\n      \n植物园温室\n\n      \n老城夜色\n\n插画灵感流\n\n筛选\n\n      \n\n      \n已收藏 236 条灵感 · 向下滚动继续加载\n\n商品封面列表\n\n🎧\n\n        \n降噪耳机 Pro\n**¥ 899**\n\n      \n🪑\n\n        \n人体工学椅\n**¥ 1,299**\n\n      \n💡\n\n        \n护眼台灯\n**¥ 199**\n\n      \n⌨️\n\n        \n机械键盘\n**¥ 349**\n\n素材模板库\n\n作品集模板\n\n免费使用\n\n      \n活动报名页\n\n免费使用\n\n      \n博客主题\n\n免费使用\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[CSS 网格布局：瀑布流布局MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Grid_layout/Masonry_layout)[多列布局的基本概念MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Multicol_layout/Basic_concepts)"}